      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        BC PNP for Early Childhood Educators in 2027: Certification, Job Offers and Childcare Draws
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-4">
        Early childhood educators have their own targeted draw in the BC PNP. Getting invited depends less on luck than on three things you can control: the right ECE certificate, an eligible employer and a well-built score.
      </p>
